Entries from the convex hull of the Fe-O system showing stable and metastable phases.
Stable phases: Fe (0.0 eV/atom), O2 (0.0 eV/atom), FeO (-2.677 eV/atom), Fe3O4 (-2.542 eV/atom), Fe2O3 (-2.456 eV/atom)
Metastable: FeO2 (-1.890 eV/atom, ~85 meV/atom above hull), Fe2O (-1.234 eV/atom, ~320 meV/atom above hull)